{"places": [{"name": "Austin Rooms for Rent", "address": "407 E 6th St Ste B, Austin, TX 78701, USA", "latitude": 30.2667172, "longitude": -97.7391028, "rating": 3.7, "rating_count": 23, "types": ["finance", "point_of_interest", "establishment"], "place_id": "ChIJ2T6fU6i1RIYRE2j6m_rIumI", "weekday_hours": ["Monday: Open 24 hours", "Tuesday: Open 24 hours", "Wednesday: Open 24 hours", "Thursday: Open 24 hours", "Friday: Open 24 hours", "Saturday: Open 24 hours", "Sunday: Open 24 hours"], "price_level": null, "reviews": ["I rented a room for two years in a home with several other tenants and everyone was kind and respectful of my personal space. The common areas were always clean and the property management was very professional and responsive to my needs. You can’t beat the price for the location. Highly recommended!!", "Austin Rooms for Rent is the only place in town to go if you need very affordable housing in Austin. I had to move quickly due to an emergency and they worked overtime to help me find a way to rent with less than stellar credit and they got me moved in within the weekend.

I lived in one of their units for four months and I was very impressed with the responsiveness of management. They addressed concerns with great reliability. Broken things were fixed or replaced within a few days.

The buildin...", "I had a very bad experience here. They pushed me to pay fast, but when it came to fixing issues or returning my deposit, they delayed and avoided responsibility. Not professional at all.", "Convenience of living downtown without the downtown price tag.  Great especially for anyone that works in the bar/server industry. The building manager Dave is amazing. Very attentive and friendly. Every time I needed anything from him it was done immediately. I would stay there again and will recommend this location to all of my friends.", "Application is fast and easy. Rate is great. It is a safe place. 2 Minutes drive to I-35. $60 monthly parking in a nearby garage or free parking under bridge of I-35 (both 10 minutes walk). It is a convenient place for young people. Would Come back in the future if needed."], "phone_number": "+1 512-900-3710"}]}
